### Quick Start Skeleton (React + Vite + Tailwind)

```bash
npm create vite@latest my-ecom -- --template react
cd my-ecom
npm i -D tailwindcss postcss autoprefixer
npx tailwindcss init -p
# Configure tailwind.config.js
npm i axios zustand
npm i @stripe/react-stripe-js @stripe/stripe-js
npm i react-router-dom
```

Add a simple `ProductCard` component, set up routing, and you’re ready to iterate.

---

